# The example extension (examples/extensions/open-tasks), installed in the empty home by
# tests/drive.rs, which also adds an overdue task to Inbox/Seismograph.md. Its count of open
# tasks is in the status line, kept current by its subscription when x ticks a task in the
# reader, and its command runs from the palette and moves the overdue task to today.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 4 open tasks
keys p
type 2026-11-05
wait-for 1 note
keys enter
wait-for Journal/2026-11-05  reading
keys x
wait-for ☐ 3 open tasks
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys :
type overdue
wait-for move every overdue open task to today
keys enter
wait-for moved 1 overdue task to today
screen
keys q
exits 0
